    "phon": "hoo'-tos",
    "thad": "1. esto, estos, etc.\n\n2. the, a, an, its, etc.\n\n3. that, those, etc.\n\n4. my, mine, yours, your, hers, its, ours, our, theirs, etc.\n\n5. his, her, its, their, our, etc.\n\n6. I, you, he, she, it, we, they, us, them, etc.\n\n7. have got, has got, had got, etc.\n\n8. am, is, are, was, were, be, been, being, etc.\n\n9. do, does, did, shall, should, will, would, can, could, may, might, must, ought to, etc.\n\n10. not, nor, never, etc.\n\n11. every, each, all, both, any, some, none, etc.\n\n12. this year, last year, next year, the year before, the following year, etc.\n\n13. today, yesterday, tomorrow, the day after, the day before, etc.\n\n14. at night, in the morning, in the afternoon, etc.\n\n15. on Monday, on Tuesday, on Wednesday, etc.",
